            <ArticleTitle>Development and Optimization of a High Titer Recombinant Lentivirus System.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>136-138</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.2144/000114590</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>To enable simple and effective high titer recombinant lentivirus production, we examined key parameters for the generation of lentivirus including: transfection optimization, media change, incubation time and DNA vector selection. These results illustrate the importance of optimizing transfection processes for high titer recombinant lentivirus production.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
